          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Bishi Bashi Special is a compilation (and conversion) of the Konami arcade titles Bishi Bashi Champ, Super Bishi Bashi Champ and Handle Champ.\n\nGameplay is made up of tons of mini games, all of which use a simple 3-button interface that mimics the arcade originals. The mini games encompass a wide variety of button-mashing, timing and button combination games. The games themselves can be anything from making hamburgers, throwing a pie down a church aisle to balancing a car on a floating narrow gravel road and much more.\n\nThe game can be played alone, vs a computer player or play up to eight people using a multi-tap and three controllers.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
